&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Understand and learn about the e-commerce industry and competitive environment including knowledge of competitive product offerings. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Provide market insights, competitive intelligence, and enterprise customer feedback to help inform Pacvue’s enterprise sales strategy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
