Senior Digital Activation Executive | Lookfantastic &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About THG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are THG, a global ecommerce group on a mission to be the global online leader in beauty and sports nutrition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our portfolio of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; leading retailers and brands such as LOOKFANTASTIC, Myprotein, ESPA, Perricone MD, and Cult Beauty form our two core businesses: THG Beauty and THG Nutrition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;From Manchester to New York, we’re powered by a team of over 2500 people who work together, lead by example, and think BIG.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;With us, you’ll go further, faster. What are you waiting for?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at THG Beauty&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We know that beauty isn’t one-size-fits-all. Our portfolio of leading retailers and iconic beauty brands caters to everyone, everywhere, empowering customers all over the world to look and feel fantastic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By combining our portfolio of owned brands inclusive of ESPA, Ameliorate and Christophe Robin,&amp;nbsp;with a marketplace for over 1,300 third-party beauty brands through online retail sites LOOKFANTASTIC, Cult Beauty, and Dermstore, THG Beauty&#39;s ambition is to be the global digital partner of choice across the beauty industry, supporting the channel shift to online.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;THG Beauty’s breadth of relationships is unique to the beauty market; it engages with brands as a retailer, a brand owner, and a product developer and manufacturer, making it the industry’s digital strategic leader.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Why be a Senior Digital Activation Executive at LOOKFANTASTIC?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;The Senior Digital Activation Executive role sits within THG Beauty&#39;s Retail Media structure, working closely with brand marketing leads, buying, trading, performance marketing and creative teams to deliver impactful, brand-funded media campaigns.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on digital activation role, combining platform expertise, campaign execution and performance analysis with brand-facing relationship management. You&#39;ll play a key role in bringing media plans to life across platforms such as Meta and TikTok, monitoring performance, making data-led optimisations and reporting on campaign success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll act as an external-facing LOOKFANTASTIC ambassador and media specialist, building relationships with our brand partners and helping them maximise their investment through effective digital activation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Digital Activation Executive&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with LOOKFANTASTIC&#39;s key brand partners, understanding their objectives and developing data-driven paid media strategies to drive brand growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, pitch and activate multi-platform digital media plans across relevant paid social and digital advertising channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take hands-on ownership of campaign activation across platforms, including Meta Business Manager and TikTok Ads Manager, managing campaign set-up, implementation and ongoing performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor live campaign performance, proactively identifying opportunities to optimise targeting, creative, budgets and delivery against agreed KPIs and ROI targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own mid-campaign and post-campaign reporting, analysing performance data, identifying key insights and demonstrating campaign uplift and return on investment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate campaign data into clear, actionable recommendations for brand partners, helping shape future media strategies and secure incremental investment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work collaboratively with our influencer team to commission high-quality influencer assets for paid media repurposing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support social-first creative and ad copy development, briefing our in-house creative team to deliver engaging, high-performing assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with wider marketing, e-commerce, buying and trading teams to ensure campaigns are aligned with wider commercial objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep up to date with emerging digital platforms, advertising features and industry trends, bringing new ideas and opportunities to improve campaign performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What skills and experience do I need for this role?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years&#39; experience in paid media, digital marketing or digital campaign activation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on experience with paid media platforms&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally Meta Business Manager and TikTok Ads Manager, with confidence setting up, managing and optimising campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills, with the ability to interpret campaign data, monitor KPIs and produce meaningful performance reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A commercial mindset, understanding how to use media investment effectively to drive performance, growth and ROI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence working with campaign budgets, targeting, creative testing and optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and presentation skills, with the ability to build relationships and confidently present campaign recommendations to external brand partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, digitally savvy individual who naturally keeps up with emerging platforms, social trends and developments in the paid media landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organised, with strong attention to detail and the ability to manage multiple campaigns and deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for beauty, e-commerce and the evolving retail media industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
