Conversational AI Specialist &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;À propos de Mirakl &lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fondée en 2012, Mirakl est à l’avant-garde de l’innovation marketplace, permettant à toutes les entreprises de rivaliser dans l’économie de plateforme.&lt;br&gt;Son operating system combine aujourd’hui des solutions pour :&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;le lancement, la gestion et la croissance d’une marketplace ou d’une activité de dropship (Mirakl Platform)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;la vente omnicanale alimentée par l’IA (Mirakl Connect)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;le retail media (Mirakl Ads)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;le commerce agentique (Mirakl Nexus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Avec ses sièges à Boston et Paris, Mirakl accompagne un écosystème mondial de plus de 450 clients B2C et B2B et un réseau de plus de 100 000 marques et vendeurs tiers.&lt;br&gt;Des marques comme Macy’s, Decathlon, Carrefour, Asos et Airbus Helicopters utilisent Mirakl pour réinventer leur approche du commerce.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pour plus d&#39;informations, rendez-vous sur www.mirakl.com.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mirakl en chiffres &lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🗓️ Fondée en 2012 | Membre de French Tech Next40&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;👥 Plus de 750 employés répartis dans 9 bureaux à travers le monde : Paris, Barcelone, Bordeaux, Boston, Londres, Munich, New York, Sydney, Tokyo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nos valeurs &lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Travailler chez Mirakl, c&#39;est accélérer votre carrière aux côtés de collègues ambitieux, passionnés et solidaires. Nous sommes fiers de la diversité des parcours, des perspectives et des expériences qui rendent nos équipes uniques.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nos 5 valeurs guident notre façon de collaborer :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💡 Travailler dur ensemble : le travail d&#39;équipe et la collaboration sont les fondements de notre succès&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏆 Aller au bout des choses : &amp;nbsp;nous privilégions l&#39;action et l&#39;efficacité pour obtenir des résultats percutants&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚀 Aller au-delà des attentes : &amp;nbsp;nous relevons les défis de manière proactive et visons toujours l&#39;excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🎓 Réussir grâce à l&#39;expertise : le partage de connaissances et l&#39;apprentissage continu sont au cœur de notre culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🤝 Satisfaire et responsabiliser les clients : nous nous engageons à assurer la réussite de nos clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-lg text-foreground&quot;&gt;The Team You&#39;ll Join&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be part of the Customer Services organization led by Alice, Manager of Digital Support, working at the intersection of Support, Product, Content, and Engineering. Together, you&#39;ll be transforming how customers, partners, and employees access support — making it easier for users to find answers, solve problems, and get help independently and efficiently.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;At the heart of this transformation is &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;One Help, Mirakl&#39;s AI-powered digital support platform&lt;/strong&gt;, combining conversational AI, product knowledge, and self-service capabilities to deliver a seamless support experience. As the functional owner of One Help, you&#39;ll be central to making that vision a reality.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-lg text-foreground&quot;&gt;Your Impact&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Own and manage One Help as its functional administrator — configuring the platform, managing AI settings, conversational flows, and user journeys, while coordinating technical improvements with Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Analyse user conversations, behaviours, and feedback to identify friction points, unanswered questions, and inaccurate answers that undermine self-service resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Test and optimise AI-generated answers, prompts, and conversational experiences — experimenting with new AI capabilities to continuously raise the quality of the digital support experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Monitor key performance indicators including answer quality, self-service resolution rates, user satisfaction, and escalation rates — translating data into prioritised, actionable improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Drive One Help adoption across Mirakl, partnering with Support, Product, and Engineering teams to evolve the platform based on real user needs and emerging AI capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-lg text-foreground&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring to the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;3 to 5 years of experience in Customer Experience, Knowledge Management (Dcoumentation, help center, knowledge base) or Customer Education, including hands-on involvement in implementing or deploying an AI chatbot or virtual assistant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience administering, configuring, or optimising conversational AI, chatbots, virtual assistants, or digital self-service platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Proven ability to analyse user behaviour and performance data to identify improvement opportunities and translate them into tangible actions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Experience with platforms such as Intercom Fin, Zendesk AI, Ada or similar is a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Familiarity with prompt engineering, AI agents, retrieval-augmented generation (RAG), or no-code/low-code automation tools is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;User experience mindset: identifying friction points and translating insights into more intuitive, effective experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Analytical thinking: comfortable with performance metrics, conversation data, and user feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Technical curiosity: practical understanding of how AI-powered tools work, including LLMs, prompts, and knowledge retrieval — coding expertise not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Cross-functional collaboration: able to work effectively with both technical and business teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Strong ownership and autonomy: proactive, resourceful, and comfortable driving a platform&#39;s evolution independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Tools&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-powered and automation tools (e.g., Dust, n8n, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge and content management platforms (Confluence, Paligo, Heretto, Gitbook, Zendesk Guide, etc)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-lg text-foreground&quot;&gt;Languages&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;English: Full professional proficiency &lt;em&gt;(required)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;French: Full professional proficiency &lt;em&gt;(required)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-lg text-foreground&quot;&gt;Our Hiring Process&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;We warmly encourage you to apply to any of our roles, even if you think you&#39;re not an exact match.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Please click the &quot;Apply&quot; button to submit your application — this helps us make the best possible assessment and get back to you as quickly as possible.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-decimal pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Screening call with Talent Acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;1-hour interview with Alice, Hiring Manager, including a live case study&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Values interviews with key stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Welcome at Mirakl!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Nous recrutons des collaborateurs aux parcours et expériences très différents pour nous aider à grandir. Ceux-ci dépassent souvent les exigences professionnelles conventionnelles et nous aident à créer une culture d&#39;apprentissage continu. Si vous êtes prêt à rejoindre un leader mondial qui soutient la transformation e-commerce de plus de 450 retailers et organisations B2B parmi les plus innovants au monde. Nous pouvons utiliser des solutions d&#39;intelligence artificielle (IA) pour rationaliser notre processus de recrutement, notamment pour présélectionner les candidatures, analyser les CV et évaluer les réponses. Si l&#39;IA nous aide à travailler efficacement, toutes les décisions finales en matière de recrutement sont prises par des humains. Pour plus d&#39;information, consultez notre &lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://info.mirakl.com/ai-guidelines-for-candidates-and-interviews&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://info.mirakl.com/ai-guidelines-for-candidates-and-interviews&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;AI Guidelines for Candidates and Interviews&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Customer Success  Paris

Senior Software Engineer &lt;p&gt;We are looking for a hands-on Autonomous Drone Software Engineer to join a swarming programme. As an engineer on a lean, high-impact team, you will have the opportunity to drive development of new features, have a say in architecture and design decisions and have real impact across all the team’s projects.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will not be siloed; this role spans the entire autonomy lifecycle, from developing autonomy capabilities to investigating real-world flight-test data.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is someone who’s a self-starter, can work independently, can work with ambiguity, can take decisions on their own and not be afraid to drive and push towards getting the project across the finish line.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership and drive the development of new features across the autonomy stack and partner integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with hardware engineers, product managers, and external partners to define system requirements and translate them into robust software architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement robust distributed state machines, leader election protocols, and fault-tolerant architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver clean, readable and maintainable code while confidently managing complex concurrency and contention scenarios&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and run rigorous tests utilizing SITL/HITL simulation environments to validate code prior to physical deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively participate in code reviews, architectural discussions, and technical documentation to elevate the team&#39;s engineering standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act decisively during flight-test investigations, applying strong engineering judgment to physical failure modes and release safety&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of professional engineering experience in robotics, embedded systems, or distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep proficiency in modern C++, with practical experience designing, reasoning about, and debugging highly concurrent systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embedded systems experience working close to hardware on real-time or safety-critical platforms (e.g., avionics, automotive, robotics).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong architectural understanding of distributed systems, with the ability to deliberately evaluate and select consensus designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with robust release management, versioned artifacts, and pinned dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with PX4, MAVLink, and related drone software ecosystems is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EU citizenship required&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stock Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company pension plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Car parking&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity &amp;amp; paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health and wellbeing support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Engineering  Zurich

Senior Project Manager Creative &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Important: For this position, it is essential that you have a good command of the Dutch language, both written and spoken.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP Media &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is het wereldwijde mediacollectief van WPP, volledig gebouwd voor het AI-tijdperk. We bundelen het beste platform, de meest getalenteerde mensen en de sterkste partners om innovatieve oplossingen te creëren. Ons doel? Merken elke dag ongeëvenaarde groei bieden. Dit fundament vinden we in onze gedeelde kernwaarden:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re Extraordinary:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We verleggen grenzen, dagen het gewone denken uit en doorbreken de status-quo in ons streven naar innovatie en groei.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re Open:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We bouwen vertrouwen en begrip door naadloos samen te werken – met onze teams, klanten en partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re Optimistic:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Een &#39;growth mindset&#39; zit in ons DNA. We omarmen verandering als dé manier om het beste uit onszelf te halen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Binnen WPP Media zijn wij het creatie team dat digitale campagnes nét dat beetje extra geeft. We mixen media, creativiteit en technologie om ideeën te maken die opvallen, raken en blijven hangen. Geen standaard banners of vluchtige clicks, maar slimme, opvallende en vaak verrassende creaties die écht aandacht trekken. Van interactieve formats tot dynamische campagnes: we zorgen dat merken niet alleen zichtbaar zijn, maar ook een glimlach, klik of wow-moment verdienen. Kortom – wij maken digitale media leuker, slimmer en effectiever.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Project Manager&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Bij ons draait alles om creatieve impact. En om dat vlekkeloos te laten verlopen, zoeken we een&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Project Manager &lt;/strong&gt;die energie krijgt van regelen, structureren én inspireren. Iemand die het creatieve proces strak organiseert, maar ook snapt dat de mooiste ideeën juist ontstaan als er ruimte is om te spelen.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Als Senior Project Manager Creative ben jij de spil tussen klant, jouw eigen creatie team en mediaspecialisten. Voor jouw klanten ben jij het eerste aanspreekpunt: je denkt mee, geeft advies en zorgt dat ideeën werkelijkheid worden.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat ga je concreet doen?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je organiseert en bewaakt het projectplan van A tot Z, inclusief scope, deadlines en deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je zorgt voor &lt;strong&gt;heldere projectstructuren&lt;/strong&gt; en planning voor alle disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent hét centrale aanspreekpunt voor klanten, interne teams en externe partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je vertaalt creatieve en commerciële briefing naar&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;uitvoerbare plannen&lt;/strong&gt; en bewaakt verwachtingen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je identificeert risico’s vroegtijdig en zorgt dat issues worden opgelost voordat ze impact hebben.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bewaakt scopes, kwaliteitscriteria en KPI’s, en rapporteert hierover.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je draagt bij aan verbeterde workflows, tools en werkwijzen zodat het team nog efficiënter werkt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je fungeert als brug tussen creatie, media en operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wie ben jij?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sterke projectmanager&lt;/strong&gt; met min. 5+ jaar ervaring in rollen die draaien om planning, coördinatie, organisatie en procesoptimalisatie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je hebt aantoonbare ervaring met het managen van complexe projecten (in agencies, techteams, productteams of andere uitvoerende omgevingen).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent een pro in overzicht houden, risico’s inschatten en structureel werken — en je weet dit zelfverzekerd te vertalen naar teams en klanten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je hebt &lt;strong&gt;geen creatieve productie-achtergrond nodig&lt;/strong&gt; (zoals design of copywriting); wat telt is jouw vermogen om projecten tot een goed einde te brengen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Voorkeur voor ervaring met middelenbegrotingen, resource-planning en KPI-gestuurde workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat bieden wij jou?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salaris:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;€&lt;strong&gt;3000 – 4250 bruto per maand&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(op basis van &lt;strong&gt;38,75 uur per&lt;/strong&gt; week) afhankelijk van ervaring, leeftijd en senioriteit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibiliteit:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Mogelijkheid om thuis te werken, flexibele werktijden én zelfs voor een tijdje in het buitenland (EU).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vrijheid: &lt;/strong&gt;Veel eigen verantwoordelijk om je eigen rol en werkdag in te vullen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Werkomgeving: &lt;/strong&gt;werken in een goed georganiseerde creatieve omgeving met een enthousiast team van creatieven, projectmanagers en mediaspecialisten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Klanten:&lt;/strong&gt; Werken voor A merken van Nederland en internationaal op projecten waar je écht trots op kunt zijn en die zichtbaar impact maken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Groeikansen&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;Volop ruimte voor ontwikkeling in een innovatief en dynamisch team, met een focus op AI-transformatie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Toegang tot M Academy:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Voor uitgebreide trainingen en workshops in zowel&amp;nbsp;hard als soft skills, inclusief specifieke AI-trainingen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reiskostenvergoeding:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Reiskosten worden volledig vergoed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8% vakantiegeld&amp;nbsp;en&amp;nbsp;26 vakantiedagen&amp;nbsp;per jaar&lt;/strong&gt; (plus 9 extra bij te kopen!).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid Working allowance:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;€30 netto&lt;/strong&gt; per maand bij fulltime.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring Your Own Device (BYOD):&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Je ontvangt een maandelijkse telefoonvergoeding van &lt;strong&gt;€57,50 netto&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lunchfaciliteiten:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Voordelige lunch in de kantine en een barista voor verse koffie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zorgverzekering:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Profiteer van onze collectieve zorgverzekering&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Geen dag is hier hetzelfde! Het ene moment duik je in een briefing met een klant, het volgende moment ben je met een creative bezig om een campagne pixel-perfect te krijgen. Je werkt met verschillende disciplines, klanten en uitdagingen, waardoor je continu leert en groeit. En jij bent degene die ervoor zorgt dat alles klopt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enthousiast? Laat van je horen en vertel ons waarom jij de Project Manager Creative bent die wij zoeken.&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Strategy  Eindhoven

Forward Deployed Engineer &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thank you for considering Tailscale. If this job description resonates with you, please apply.&amp;nbsp;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Frequently cited statistics show that people who identify with historically marginalized groups are likely to apply to jobs only if they meet 100% of the qualifications. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We encourage you to help us break that statistic!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Tailscale&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tailscale is making safe connection effortless by delivering software that makes it easy to securely interconnect people and their devices, no matter where they are. From hobbyists to multinational corporations, teams of every size use Tailscale each day to protect their networks, share access to internal tools, and more. We&#39;re building a future for the Internet that&#39;s easy, sensible, and safe, like it used to be. Founded in 2019 and fully distributed, we&#39;re backed by Accel, CRV, Insight, Heavybit, and Uncork Capital.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Forward Deployed Engineer at Tailscale, you’ll be the bridge between our technical capabilities and the needs of our most strategic customers. You will work directly with customers to ensure their success with Tailscale’s products, helping them get onboarded, driving their long-term adoption, and providing expert technical guidance throughout their journey. This role requires a combination of technical proficiency, problem-solving skills, and an empathetic customer-centric approach to ensure customers are fully empowered to leverage the power of Tailscale. The role will report directly to Zach Buchheit, Team Lead, Customer Success Engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and manage the onboarding process for new strategic customers, ensuring they quickly understand and adopt Tailscale. Provide training and resources that set customers up for long-term success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Offer technical support for customers, diagnosing and resolving issues across Tailscale&#39;s platform. Assist with configuration, integration, and troubleshooting to ensure smooth implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct QBRs with customers to review usage, success metrics, and future goals. Use these touchpoints to identify opportunities for deeper engagement and horizontal expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with customers, acting as a trusted advisor. Help customers optimize their use of Tailscale by identifying best practices, and by providing recommendations based on their specific use cases and desired business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the voice of the customer internally, relaying feedback and insights to the product and engineering teams to help improve the product and the customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with sales, product, engineering, and support teams to ensure smooth handoffs, escalate critical issues, and drive customer success across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain a repository of technical documentation, FAQs, and guides to help customers self-serve. Share insights and best practices with both the customer and internal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ Years in a technical role with minimum 2 years of customer-facing experience (Solutions engineer/architect, Sr. Support Engineer, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with enterprise customers in a consultative capacity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of networking, VPNs, and security principles. Experience with cloud infrastructure (AWS, GCP, Azure) and tools like Docker, Kubernetes, and other DevOps technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in a customer-facing technical role such as Technical Support Engineer, Solutions Engineer/architect, or Customer Success Engineer at a SaaS company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to clearly explain complex technical concepts to a diverse audience, from non-technical stakeholders to engineers. Strong written and verbal communication skills are a must&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical mindset and troubleshooting skills, with the ability to think critically and methodically to resolve complex technical issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for delivering excellent customer service and a strong focus on building long-term customer relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple customer accounts, prioritize tasks, and keep projects on track. Strong time management and organizational skills are key&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative mindset and ability to work cross-functionally with product, sales, and engineering teams to deliver customer success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a company, we strive to maintain fair and equitable compensation practices within our team across all roles and all levels. Tailscale&#39;s compensation package includes base salary, equity, and comprehensive benefits. The salary range displayed on each job posting represents the target range for a new hire&#39;s base salary. Individual offers may vary based on experience and skill set.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For this position, our pay ranges reflect target OTE (on target earnings), inclusive of base salary and variable compensation tied to the attainment of quarterly sales targets.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;UK Pay Range (OTE)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£118,500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£197,500 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An inclusive, flexible environment where you can be your authentic self.&lt;/strong&gt; We recognize the impact of diverse voices and backgrounds on the growth of our people, product, and company. And that flexibility in how and when you work empowers our team to integrate work and life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A competitive total compensation package.&lt;/strong&gt; This includes a base salary, an equity incentive plan and variable commission (for quota-based roles).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comprehensive group benefits with no waiting period. &lt;/strong&gt;Take advantage of coverage for health, vision, dental, and more for you and your family!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote first company&lt;/strong&gt;—most of our teams work fully remotely. Enjoy a change of scenery wherever you can get wifi, participate in virtual and in-person social events, and leverage our corporate co-working program to visit WeWork (or other similar spaces near you). Some roles require in-office collaboration depending on team needs, which will be clearly noted in the job description.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employer-funded retirement contributions. &lt;/strong&gt;Tailscale will match your retirement contributions dollar-for-dollar, up to a maximum annual employer contribution equal to 0.75% of your eligible compensation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connect with other Tailscalars IRL. &lt;/strong&gt;Attend our annual company retreat, participate in team off-sites, and collaborate in person with teammates across Canada, the United States, the United Kingdom, and Singapore. We support intentional in-person connection through team travel and distributed collaboration.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support for your personal and professional development.&lt;/strong&gt; Grow your career thoughtfully with $1500 USD annually for professional development, or take advantage of mentorship, coaching, and internal promotion opportunities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid time off and a healthy work-life integration.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Our flexible, paid time off program supports you for any situation life throws your way, whether moving homes or travelling the world!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A build-your-own home office setup. &lt;/strong&gt;You choose your own company-owned laptop (Mac or PC), receive a monthly home internet reimbursement, and $500 USD to customize your workstation to make it your own.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid parental leave program&lt;/strong&gt;. We care about your life outside of work and encourage new parents to take advantage of parental leave top-ups (20 weeks for birthing parents, 16 weeks for non-birthing parents).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tailscale is committed to providing an accessible and inclusive hiring process. If you require an accommodation at any stage of the recruitment process or related to any aspect of this role, please contact your recruiter.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our hiring process uses AI-assisted tools to help screen and assess candidates. All hiring decisions are made by people.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please be aware that legitimate emails from Tailscale&#39;s talent team will only originate from ----- ----- and ----- email addresses. For more information about protecting yourself from impersonators and scams, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://tailscale.com/scam-awareness&quot;&gt;https://tailscale.com/scam-awareness&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Customer Success

Head of Digital Platform & Data &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;PHENOGY AG is a leading innovator of battery energy storage technologies and solutions for the green electrification of the planet. Our team members work on future-proof and sustainable battery systems that are powerful, safe, and robust – with circularity as a central principle. Our technology partner network spans leading battery research institutes. PHENOGY is an environmentally and socially conscious enterprise. We are committed to fostering prosperity for the people and our planet, ensuring sustainable growth – starting in the area of our greatest expertise and impact: energy storage solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We energize the future.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;PHENOGY is seeking curious, entrepreneurial-minded energy pioneers to help shape our vision, systems, and growth; playing a key-role as we launch into our ambitious future. If you’re inspired by our mission, values, and drive to change how we energize the future — we’d love your application.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt; At PHENOGY, we energize the future—sustainably. In this role&amp;nbsp;you will define and execute our digital engineering strategy, owning the architecture, security, quality, and lifecycle of our cloud, edge, and data products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Operating at the intersection of clean energy and industrial IoT, you will lead the digital ecosystem for our Battery Energy Storage Systems (BESS) &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;148&quot;&gt;from the gateway upward&lt;/strong&gt;—connecting Edge/Gateway → Cloud Infrastructure → APIs → Monitoring/NOC → Customer Applications &amp;amp; Data Platforms. Working in close alignment with our Embedded Systems lead, Product, Cybersecurity, Operations, and Quality teams, you will turn complex energy and regulatory requirements into scalable, high-availability software and data platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What You Will Own &amp;amp; Lead&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Platform &amp;amp; Data Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Define our technology roadmap, sourcing model (in-house vs. external), and application/data architecture. Establish clear boundaries, data models, APIs, and technical standards from the gateway layer through edge computing, cloud services, data pipelines, and customer/Battery Passport platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Engineering, DevOps &amp;amp; Quality:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead internal engineers and external partners. Govern the full software lifecycle—from requirements and Git workflows to automated CI/CD pipelines, environment segregation, release/rollback procedures, and end-of-life decommissioning. Champion automated testing (unit, integration, performance, regression) and proactively manage technical debt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Product Cybersecurity &amp;amp; Compliance:&lt;/strong&gt; Embed Security-by-Design via a Secure Software Development Lifecycle (SSDLC). Oversee secure coding, secrets/certificate management, SBOMs, open-source licensing, vulnerability remediation (SAST/DAST/SCA), and penetration testing across our edge and cloud stack in alignment with ISO/IEC 27001, IEC 62443, NIST SSDF, OWASP, NIS2, and the EU Cyber Resilience Act.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Connected Fleet &amp;amp; Data Ecosystem:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive high-throughput telemetry ingestion, operational data processing, analytics, remote diagnostics, gateway/edge over-the-air (OTA) updates, and secure remote access across our connected storage fleet.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional &amp;amp; Embedded Interface Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with the Embedded Systems lead (who owns BMS, controllers, and string-level firmware) to define clean gateway protocols and data contracts—ensuring seamless integration without overlapping responsibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Team &amp;amp; Supplier Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Build, mentor, and scale a high-performing platform and data engineering organization. Manage external development partners from technical due diligence and contracting through delivery, ensuring clean IP ownership, documentation, and zero single-vendor lock-in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Executive Governance &amp;amp; IT Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Hold decision-making authority over digital platform architecture, tech stacks, repositories, CI/CD, and technical debt. Partner closely with the Head of IT to maintain a clear boundary between product software and enterprise IT while jointly governing shared domains (IAM, cloud infrastructure, networking, incident response, and disaster recovery).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, Data Engineering, IT, or a related technical field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;11,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record leading software/data teams, complex engineering programs, and external development vendors, translating business goals into clear roadmaps and architectural decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;11,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Modern Cloud, API &amp;amp; Data Tech:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep expertise in cloud-native software architecture, data pipelines/telemetry processing, integration patterns, REST/streaming APIs, DevOps, CI/CD automation, and full-lifecycle release management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;11,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Security Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong command of secure software engineering practices, vulnerability management, and risk-based decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;11,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to bridge deep technical execution with executive stakeholder alignment—balancing speed, cost, quality, and operational risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strongly Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot;&gt;Domain experience in Energy Tech, BESS, Industrial IoT, Edge computing, or connected fleet platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;13,1,0&quot;&gt;Hands-on familiarity with Microsoft Azure, Azure DevOps, C#/.NET, Python, modern data stacks, and REST APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2,0&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of IEC 62443 and cybersecurity standards for connected industrial products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;13,3,0&quot;&gt;Experience managing high-availability operational systems and formal product lifecycle management (PLM).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;How Success Is Measured&lt;/strong&gt; You will have clear ownership backed by transparent engineering metrics, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;15,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Delivery &amp;amp; Reliability:&lt;/strong&gt; Roadmap predictability, release frequency, deployment success/rollback rates, platform availability, and incident trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;15,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Code, Data &amp;amp; Security Health:&lt;/strong&gt; Automated test coverage, data pipeline reliability/latency, CI/CD maturity, defect rates/MTTR, critical vulnerability remediation speed, and technical debt reduction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;15,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Governance &amp;amp; Efficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Architecture documentation completeness, supplier delivery quality, and R&amp;amp;D resource efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
