Senior Live Ops Manager - Onboarding & Retention | Betty CA &lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Betty is an innovative entertainment company pioneering at the intersection of real-money online casinos and casual mobile gaming.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Betty Canada &lt;/strong&gt;is a scale up company accredited by the Alcohol and Gaming Commission of Ontario (AGCO) as a B2C operator in February 2023, and by the Alberta Gaming, Liquor and Cannabis Commission (AGLC) in Alberta. We’re here to set a new standard in the industry.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our mission is to redefine the online casino experience by offering a uniquely transparent environment where players can relax, unwind, and enjoy themselves safely. We are committed to accessibility, fairness, and inclusivity, fostering a community of like-minded individuals who value ethical gaming practices and prioritize our players’ safety and enjoyment above everything else.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role: &lt;/strong&gt;We are looking for a Senior Live Ops Manager – Onboarding &amp;amp; Retention to own and continuously optimize the early player lifecycle, from registration and onboarding through activation, progression and Month-1 Retention. This is not a traditional campaign-management role. The position sits at the intersection of Live Ops, Product, Data and Development, combining hands-on execution with experimentation, lifecycle strategy and Product optimization. The role will work within a cross-functional Retention domain, using player behaviour and data to identify opportunities, design solutions, launch experiments and continuously improve the player experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are honest&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;- we value honesty in all aspects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring the Olives&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;- we offer premium customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Think Big&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;- we believe in always striving for more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the lifecycle strategy for Onboarding, Activation and New-player Retention, translating business goals into Live Ops and Product initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously optimize the early player lifecycle across retention (D1-D7-M1).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify player drop-offs and opportunities using Retention, funnel, engagement and player-value data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage lifecycle journeys directly in Smartico, including segmentation, triggers, communications and experimentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and run A/B tests across journeys, offers, onboarding experiences and lifecycle mechanics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product, Engineering and Design to shape and deliver Retention-related Product initiatives across the early player lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate Live Ops and player-behaviour insights into clear Product requirements and experimentation opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with BI and Data to define measurement frameworks, dashboards, event requirements and success metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and optimize key lifecycle initiatives such as Push Enablement, Welcome Offers, onboarding journeys and early progression mechanics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate experiment results and decide what to scale, iterate or stop based on measurable impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure Product and Live Ops experiences work together as one player journey rather than separate communication and Product layers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the domain in cross-functional planning and collaborate with other Live Ops squads on shared Retention opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present findings, recommendations and performance insights to senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stronger D1, D7 and M1 Retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved onboarding and early lifecycle progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved conversion from FTD to subsequent deposits and valuable player actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Faster and more structured experimentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increased use of behavioural data in Live Ops and Product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reduced friction between Live Ops, Product and Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;More Retention initiatives moving from insight → experiment → measurable outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Several years’ experience working in Live Ops and/or Product teams within mobile gaming, social casino, or real-money gaming, with hands-on experience across player engagement, lifecycle, onboarding and retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of improving Retention, activation, engagement or player value through measurable initiatives and continuous optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Product and player-journey thinking, with experience across onboarding, FTUE, progression, engagement loops, missions, rewards or other lifecycle mechanics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experimentation and analytical skills, including A/B testing, control groups, incrementality, cohort analysis, segmentation, funnels and player-value models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to use data to identify problems, form hypotheses, prioritize opportunities and translate insights into clear Product, Live Ops and technical requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with CRM / marketing automation platforms, including building lifecycle journeys, triggers, segmentation and player communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working cross-functionally with Product, Engineering, Design, BI and Data, and the ability to drive initiatives from discovery through launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead cross-functional initiatives, influence senior stakeholders and make clear prioritization decisions without relying on formal authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercially minded, balancing player experience with measurable impact across Retention, conversion, monetization, and long-term player value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ownership, decision-making and ability to operate independently in a fast-moving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Smartico.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience optimizing FTUE, onboarding or early-player lifecycle experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with online casino, social casino or free-to-play Product mechanics such as challenges, progression systems, loyalty or gamification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Premium Health insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career and skills development opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fun and collaborative team environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New modern office space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;At this time, we are unable to sponsor work visas for this position. Candidates must be authorized to work in the job posting location for this position on a full time basis without the need for current or future visa sponsorship.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are an equal opportunities employer and welcome applications from all suitably qualified individuals, regardless of age, disability, gender, gender identity or expression, marital or civil partnership status, pregnancy or maternity, race, religion or belief, or sexual orientation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
